           &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;It's a Swedish musical takeover! Or do we call it a smorgasbord? Hosts Bobby Carter and Anamaria Sayre share sets from the folk duo &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/artists/141233981/first-aid-kit" target="_blank"&gt;First Aid Kit&lt;/a&gt;, R&amp;B singer &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/artists/718208540/snoh-aalegra" target="_blank"&gt;Snoh Aalegra&lt;/a&gt; and pop star &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/artists/90029878/robyn" target="_blank"&gt;Robyn&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;Look for &lt;em&gt;Tiny Desk Radio&lt;/em&gt; on your local NPR station.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;First Aid Kit: Tiny Desk Concert&lt;/h3&gt;    &lt;div id="resg-s1-154907-100" class="bucketwrap video youtube-video large"&gt;     &lt;div class="video-wrap"&gt;         &lt;iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Jtx7q7_IUXc?rel=0" width="100%" height="100%" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen=""&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;         &lt;div class="credit-caption externalasset"&gt;                               &lt;b class="credit"&gt;                                          &lt;b class="source"&gt;YouTube&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;/b&gt;         &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;Snoh Aalegra: Tiny Desk Concert&lt;/h3&gt;    &lt;div id="resg-s1-154907-101" class="bucketwrap video youtube-video large"&gt;     &lt;div class="video-wrap"&gt;         &lt;iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Qll7IHN0I4Q?rel=0" width="100%" height="100%" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen=""&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;         &lt;div class="credit-caption externalasset"&gt;                               &lt;b class="credit"&gt;                                          &lt;b class="source"&gt;YouTube&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;/b&gt;         &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;Robyn: Tiny Desk Concert&lt;/h3&gt;    &lt;div id="resg-s1-154907-102" class="bucketwrap video youtube-video large"&gt;     &lt;div class="video-wrap"&gt;         &lt;iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/R39hGT1iM7w?rel=0" width="100%" height="100%" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen=""&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;         &lt;div class="credit-caption externalasset"&gt;                               &lt;b class="credit"&gt;                                          &lt;b class="source"&gt;YouTube&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;/b&gt;         &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p&gt;Tiny Desk Radio &lt;em&gt;is produced by Noah Caldwell and Walter Ray Watson. Our editor is Lars Gotrich, and our technical director is Neil Tevault. Suraya Mohamed is the executive producer of NPR Music, and Sonali Mehta is NPR's VP of Music. Our theme was composed by Kaelin Ellis.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;</description>
